OL,3,AAirlines criticise air traffic control
OL,4,Aafter second glitch this month causes
OL,5,Amore disruption
OL,6,
OL,7,FFlights across the UK are being
OL,8,Fdisrupted by a "technical issue" with
OL,9,Fair traffic control - here are the
OL,10,Fairports affected
OL,12,FNats, which runs air traffic control,
OL,13,Fsays it was a "connectivity issue with
OL,14,Fpart of our systems network" - and had
OL,15,F"nothing to do" with a software defect
OL,16,Fthat led to the cancellation of 2,000
OL,17,Fflights across the UK earlier this
OL,18,Fmonth
OL,20,FThe issue at Nats' Prestwick centre in
OL,21,FAyrshire is "now fixed", it adds
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
