OL,3,AAirlines criticise air traffic control
OL,4,Aafter second glitch this month causes
OL,5,Amore disruption
OL,6,
OL,7,FEasyJet says this "once again calls
OL,8,Finto questions the resilience of Nats'
OL,9,Fsystems" and Ryanair says Nats has
OL,10,Ffailed to deliver "either a reliable
OL,11,Fsystem or an effective back-up"
OL,13,FMeanwhile, trade body Airlines UK says
OL,14,Fboth passengers and airlines "deserve
OL,15,Fbetter"
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/38
