OL,3,AYoung people aren't snowflakes - mental
OL,4,Adistress is rising, says head of
OL,5,Aofficial review
OL,6,
OL,7,FAccusations that the young are a
OL,8,Fsnowflake generation are wrong, the
OL,9,Fhead of an independent review into
OL,10,Fmental health, ADHD and autism has told
OL,11,Fthe BBC.
OL,13,FProf Peter Fonagy said in an exclusive
OL,14,Finterview that there had been a real
OL,15,Frise in mental distress among children
OL,16,Fand young people, with anxiety,
OL,17,Fdepression, self-harm and eating
OL,18,Fdisorders the most common.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
